:{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["breakpoint"]},{"tool":{"name":"il2cpp_type_graph","description":"Build a flowchart of outgoing TYPE dependencies for an exact class or namespace selection. image is optional; namespace='' explicitly selects the global namespace. Includes base classes, interfaces, field types and optional method parameter/return types. Returns indexed nodes/edges, Mermaid flowchart text and explicit truncated flag. Not a runtime object graph or incoming-reference scan. No property getters/game methods are invoked. Export Mermaid/JSON through existing workspace_export_text if needed.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"image":{"type":"string","maxLength":512},"namespace":{"type":"string","maxLength":512},"class_name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":512},"depth":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":4},"max_nodes":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":128},"method_types":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":[],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["il2cpp_metadata"]},{"tool":{"name":"logic_program_schema","description":"Read the native JSON logic language, operators, limits and an example. No Lua or game calls are executed.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"required":[],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["overlay_ui"]},{"tool":{"name":"logic_program_validate","description":"Validate a complete native logic definition without saving or running it. Expressions use {var:name} or {op:name,args:[...]}; statements: let/store/if/foreach/while/return/assert/break/continue/emit/log. Named functions, bounded loops, math/collections/strings and staged exact managed calls. Read logic_program_schema first.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"descriptor":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":24,"pattern":"[A-Za-z0-9_-]+"},"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":128},"version":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":1},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"auto_start":{"type":"boolean"},"allow_calls":{"type":"boolean"},"functions":{"type":"object","maxProperties":32,"additionalProperties":{"type":"object","properties":{"params":{"type":"array","maxItems":16,"items":{"type":"string","maxLength":64}},"steps":{"type":"array","maxItems":128,"items":{"type":"object"}}},"required":["params","steps"],"additionalProperties":false}},"interval_ms":{"type":"integer","minimum":20,"maximum":60000},"budget_us":{"type":"integer","minimum":500,"maximum":12000},"max_steps":{"type":"integer","minimum":100,"maximum":100000},"default_visible":{"type":"boolean"},"sources":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":24,"pattern":"[A-Za-z0-9_-]+"},"image":{"type":"string","maxLength":256,"minLength":1},"namespace":{"type":"string","maxLength":256},"class":{"type":"string","maxLength":256,"minLength":1},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":128},"include_inactive":{"type":"boolean"},"select_new":{"type":"boolean"},"refresh_ms":{"type":"integer","minimum":20,"maximum":60000}},"required":["id","image","class"],"additionalProperties":false},"minItems":0,"maxItems":4},"steps":{"type":"array","maxItems":128,"items":{"type":"object"}}},"required":["id","steps"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["descriptor"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["overlay_ui"]},{"tool":{"name":"logic_program_set","description":"Create or replace a native game-thread JSON program (64 KiB, up to 8 programs), independent of Lua. New programs default stopped. Own symbolic sources rediscover instances; select_new defaults true and is configurable; field/static_field paths are resolved from current objects each tick. emit render sets visible/label/style; emit variable updates UI bindings. interval_ms defaults 100, budget_us 6000, max_steps 20000. default_visible=false hides unclassified source objects. auto_start is an explicit preset startup choice; save the default workspace preset to persist. Runtime object caches and program state are not restored; use symbolic sources and static fields, never persist literal object addresses. Optional functions={name:{params,steps}}; call expression invokes a local function (depth8). allow_calls=true enables emit kind=call with unique target id and value={image,namespace,class,token,instance,arguments}; auto_start must be false. Calls execute on later game frames, not inline. call_result(id) returns pending/success/result/error. Identical ids are deduplicated for the program lifetime (64 ids,8 new calls/tick); changed arguments with the same id fail. Stop/error/remove cancels queued calls; already executed game changes cannot roll back. Explicit restart may repeat calls. Unsupported runtime APIs fail only that call. get/list expose receipts; omitted large results can be queried by workspace_result while retained.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"descriptor":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":24,"pattern":"[A-Za-z0-9_-]+"},"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":128},"version":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":1},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"auto_start":{"type":"boolean"},"allow_calls":{"type":"boolean"},"functions":{"type":"object","maxProperties":32,"additionalProperties":{"type":"object","properties":{"params":{"type":"array","maxItems":16,"items":{"type":"string","maxLength":64}},"steps":{"type":"array","maxItems":128,"items":{"type":"object"}}},"required":["params","steps"],"additionalProperties":false}},"interval_ms":{"type":"integer","minimum":20,"maximum":60000},"budget_us":{"type":"integer","minimum":500,"maximum":12000},"max_steps":{"type":"integer","minimum":100,"maximum":100000},"default_visible":{"type":"boolean"},"sources":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":24,"pattern":"[A-Za-z0-9_-]+"},"image":{"type":"string","maxLength":256,"minLength":1},"namespace":{"type":"string","maxLength":256},"class":{"type":"string","maxLength":256,"minLength":1},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":128},"include_inactive":{"type":"boolean"},"select_new":{"type":"boolean"},"refresh_ms":{"type":"integer","minimum":20,"maximum":60000}},"required":["id","image","class"],"additionalProperties":false},"minItems":0,"maxItems":4},"steps":{"type":"array","maxItems":128,"items":{"type":"object"}}},"required":["id","steps"],"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["descriptor"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["overlay_ui","rendering","il2cpp_metadata","il2cpp_objects","memory_read","il2cpp_invoke"]},{"tool":{"name":"logic_program_list","description":"List native programs, running state, execution time/steps, error path, bounded logs and runtime state.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"required":[],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["overlay_ui","rendering","il2cpp_metadata","il2cpp_objects","memory_read"]},{"tool":{"name":"logic_program_get","description":"Read one native logic program including its full definition and diagnostics.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":24,"pattern":"[A-Za-z0-9_-]+"}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["overlay_ui","rendering","il2cpp_metadata","il2cpp_objects","memory_read"]},{"tool":{"name":"logic_program_control","description":"Start, stop or restart a native program. Restart clears state. Stop removes only its owned class trackers and display overrides; other programs and manual selections survive.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":24,"pattern":"[A-Za-z0-9_-]+"},"operation":{"type":"string","enum":["start","stop","restart"]}},"required":["id","operation"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["overlay_ui","rendering","il2cpp_metadata","il2cpp_objects","memory_read","il2cpp_invoke"]},{"tool":{"name":"logic_program_remove","description":"Remove one native program and its owned class trackers. Does not destroy game objects.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":24,"pattern":"[A-Za-z0-9_-]+"}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["overlay_ui","rendering","il2cpp_metadata","il2cpp_objects","memory_read"]},{"tool":{"name":"il2cpp_relation_selection","description":"Manage named multi-class relationship selections: create/list/get/append/remove/clear/delete. Append arbitrary numbers via batches <=128 selectors, not fixed two/three arguments; aggregate process-local selection budget 4 MiB and 64 named sets. Get returns revision; mutations require that decimal-string revision, preventing lost updates. Select exact image/namespace/class_name. A field on the first ordered selector constrains the first edge (World.player); a field on a later selector is an exact terminal field (Player.health), including scalar endpoints. Selections do not persist raw runtime addresses. Use debug projects to retain symbolic configuration.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"op":{"type":"string","enum":["create","list","get","append","remove","clear","delete"]},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":96},"revision":{"type":"string","pattern":"[1-9][0-9]{0,19}","maxLength":20},"types":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"image":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":512},"namespace":{"type":"string","maxLength":512},"class_name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":512},"field":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":512}},"required":["image","class_name"],"additionalProperties":false},"minItems":1,"maxItems":128},"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":256}},"required":["op"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["il2cpp_metadata"]},{"tool":{"name":"il2cpp_relation_find","description":"Find directed field paths across all selectors in a named set; intermediate unselected classes allowed. any returns links between selected types (one selector explores outgoing paths). all returns a connecting NETWORK and all_connected/components, not necessarily one chain through all types. ordered returns acyclic paths visiting selectors in supplied order. max_depth<=15; all budgets return explicit partial stop_reasons. Metadata references (optional inheritance/interfaces), static fields, references, inline value types and scalar endpoints are distinguished; only valid instance-field paths are loadable. Returns summary/session_id; page paths/nodes/edges using relation_results. Latest four successful searches retained per process. No methods invoked.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"set":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":96},"revision":{"type":"string","pattern":"[1-9][0-9]{0,19}","maxLength":20},"mode":{"type":"string","enum":["any","all","ordered"]},"strategy":{"type":"string","enum":["shortest","all_paths"],"default":"shortest","description":"shortest uses breadth-first search and returns one shortest path per directed selected pair (first complete ordered chain); all_paths enumerates alternative acyclic paths within budgets. Type metadata is cached per search, never across stale runtime lifetimes."},"max_depth":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":15},"max_results":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":512},"max_nodes":{"type":"integer","minimum":16,"maximum":4096},"work_limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":100,"maximum":100000},"time_ms":{"type":"integer","minimum":50,"maximum":10000},"include_metadata":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["set","revision"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["il2cpp_metadata"]},{"tool":{"name":"il2cpp_relation_results","description":"Page a saved relationship search's paths/nodes/edges. Paths display DeclaringType.field(0xOFFSET) -> ... and include symbolic field/type descriptors, kind and loadable. Offset is NOT an absolute address. After resolving a path, navigate address via workspace_navigate kind=object/memory; field/type descriptors use existing type tools. Response next_offset accounts for the 192-KiB page byte budget. Expired sessions fail explicitly.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"session_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"[0-9]+-[0-9]+-[0-9]+","maxLength":64,"description":"Opaque process-epoch search ID returned by relation_find; never reuse after target restart."},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["paths","nodes","edges","selection"]},"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":256}},"required":["session_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["il2cpp_metadata"]},{"tool":{"name":"il2cpp_relation_resolve","description":"Queue checked live traversal of a saved LOADABLE relationship path. Supply exactly one root_address (actual managed object) or root_recipe (existing module/pointer-chain recipe whose final address is the root object). Use dereference_final=true if recipe resolves an object pointer slot. Verifies exact class identity, field layout, object bounds and every copied read; expired/wrong/derived-only headers fail instead of invoking unknown APIs. Returns pending/request_id; poll workspace_result. Result nodes contain type, storage_address, object address, scalar/string text and render eligibility for clickable inspection, memory edit/freeze and existing render tools. Static/inheritance/interface paths cannot be dereferenced. Strings have bounded UTF-16 decoding and truncation status. No writes/getters/constructors are executed.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"session_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"[0-9]+-[0-9]+-[0-9]+","maxLength":64,"description":"Opaque process-epoch search ID returned by relation_find; never reuse after target restart."},"path_id":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":511},"root_address":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":32,"pattern":"(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F]+|[0-9]+)"},"root_recipe":{"type":"object","properties":{"module":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":512},"occurrence":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":4096},"base_address":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":32,"pattern":"(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F]+|[0-9]+)"},"base_offset":{"type":["string","integer"],"maxLength":32,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"maximum":9007199254740991},"offsets":{"type":"array","items":{"type":["string","integer"],"maxLength":32,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"maximum":9007199254740991},"minItems":0,"maxItems":32},"pointer_size":{"type":"integer","enum":[4,8]},"dereference_final":{"type":"boolean"},"label":{"type":"string","maxLength":256}},"required":["offsets"],"additionalProperties":false},"max_string_chars":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":8192}},"required":["session_id","path_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},"features":["il2cpp_metadata","il2cpp_objects","memory_read"]},{"tool":{"name":"debugger_status","descrip